## 7. Success Criteria

The AI system will be considered successful when:

1. All performance metrics meet or exceed targets for 3 consecutive months
2. Fairness metrics remain within acceptable ranges
3. No critical security incidents
4. Positive user feedback (NPS ≥ 50)
5. Business KPIs show measurable improvement

